  "concepts": ["hash_set", "hash_map"],
  "prerequisites": ["arrays"],
  "story": "A box of numbered tokens arrives in no particular order, some numbers more than once. A streak is a set of numbers that follow each other with no gap, like 4, 5, 6, 7. How long is the longest streak you can make from the numbers in the box? Repeated numbers do not make a streak longer. A big box must be checked quickly.",
